\label{def:cell-conc}
For $j\le J_{\max}$ and nonzero $v\in H_j$, define the maximum cell energy fraction
\begin{equation}\label{eq:conc-def}
\conc_j(v) \;:=\; \max_{c\in\mathcal{C}_j}\frac{\|P_{j,c}v\|^2}{\|v\|^2}.
\end{equation}
We set $\conc_j(0):=0$ by convention.

