A state $u\in H$ is \emph{SPT-legal} (with threshold $K_\kappa$) if for every $j\le J_{\max}$ with $u_j\neq 0$ one has
\begin{equation}\label{eq:spt-legal}
\kappa_j(u_j)\le K_\kappa.
\end{equation}

