\label{def:deloc}
A channel family $\{\psi_{j,r}\}_{r=1}^{m_j}$ is \emph{cell-delocalized} with constant $\kappa_0(j)\ge 1$ if
\begin{equation}\label{eq:deloc-hyp}
\max_{c\in\mathcal{C}_j}\|P_{j,c}\psi_{j,r}\|^2
\;\le\;
\kappa_0(j)\, f_j\,\|\psi_{j,r}\|^2
\qquad
\text{for all } r.
\end{equation}

